{"candidateAnswer":"Salads, sandwiches, homemade desserts, banana split sundae","evidence":"[D13:18 | 3:18 pm on 4 May, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! It had lots of great things like salads, sandwiches, and homemade desserts. My favorite is the amazing banana split sundae - I enjoy it after a day of volunteering. It's a little moment of joy in life - balance is key!","itemId":"urn:uuid:b1f7e526-2807-577b-8c9b-ec6854ac7e95","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:638f5ce6d5dfa65496309abf0f1254b5a066fd840b33d92797e8271a5808c8d9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of food did Maria have on her dinner spread iwth her mother?","referenceAnswer":"Salads, sandwiches, homemade desserts","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"638f5ce6d5dfa65496309abf0f1254b5a066fd840b33d92797e8271a5808c8d9"}}]}